{"parentUuid":"85a299fe-a108-47a3-9db1-9a89e715fc21","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"eb903157-6eb9-4dd8-8710-2e428622c046","agentId":"a08abe0c37f20c6b8","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01P44uAhY9SnaPyhRqx8tbq3","type":"tool_result","content":"# Proto Field Extraction - SatParameters\n\n## (1) use_lb_relax_lns\n**Line 2181-2183**\n```proto\noptional bool use_lb_relax_lns = 255 [default = true];\n```\n\n## (2) lb_relax_num_workers_threshold\n**Line 2185-2186**\n```proto\noptional int32 lb_relax_num_workers_threshold = 296 [default = 16];\n```\n\n## (3) optimize_with_lb_tree_search\n**Line 2078-2079**\n```proto\noptional bool optimize_with_lb_tree_search = 188 [default = false];\n```\n\n## (4) save_lp_basis_in_lb_tree_search\n**Line 2083-2085**\n```proto\noptional bool save_lp_basis_in_lb_tree_search = 284 [default = false];\n```\n\n## (5) Subsolver Names Comment Block\n**Line 1659-1677** (excerpt):\n```\n// See cp_model_search.cc to see a list of the names and the default value \n// (if left empty) that looks like:\n// - default_lp           (linearization_level:1)\n// - fixed                (only if fixed search specified or scheduling)\n// - no_lp                (linearization_level:0)\n// - max_lp               (linearization_level:2)\n// - pseudo_costs         (only if objective, change search heuristic)\n// - reduced_costs        (only if objective, change search heuristic)\n// - quick_restart        (kind of probing)\n// - quick_restart_no_lp  (kind of probing with linearization_level:0)\n// - lb_tree_search       (to improve lower bound, MIP like tree search)\n// - probing              (continuous probing and shaving)\n```\n\n## (6) Fields Referencing \"lb_tree_search\"\n1. **Line 1674**: Documentation mention in subsolver list\n2. **Line 2078-2079**: `optimize_with_lb_tree_search` field definition\n3. **Line 2083-2085**: `save_lp_basis_in_lb_tree_search` field definition"}]},"uuid":"2539683a-cf8a-47f8-a216-ec9c82b1c16e","